  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration Assistance for Victims of Trafficking and Cabaret Dancers Who Have Been Exploited in Switzerland</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project, on-going since 2010, aims to facilitate the voluntary return of victims and witnesses of human trafficking identified in Switzerland, as well as victims according to the Victim Support Act within the prostitution sector, and to contribute to their sustainable reintegration in their country of origin. This specific project foresees a flexible and efficient operational and administrative framework to ensure a dignified and needs-tailored return of this highly vulnerable target group.</narrative>
  </description>
